      "side": 1,
      "message": "MeterIds are unique, no?\nConsider using a ConcurrentHashSet which will have faster removal than a CopyOnWriteArrayList when there are thousands of meters",
      "revId": "15527383ab3b1994e889327dd203003a7f792b2d",
      "serverId": "2a2bfe1b-c5c2-48ed-9ac8-16438ab24388",
